  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><div><h2>Purpose and Benefits</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"4cea7481-aaba-4b09-89b5-8bba0f1225af\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This feature was introduced in Bahmni V0.93</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p>The Order Tab allows the user to define any products or services to be ordered for the patient.</p><p>For example, if you would want to have &ldquo;Counseling&rdquo; as order type displayed on &ldquo;orders&rdquo; tab of consultation, it may look something like below</p></div><p><br /></p><p><ac:image ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot 2021-09-29 at 4.28.17 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p><br /></p><div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Order Placement tab</strong></p></div><h2>Master Data Setup</h2><ol><li><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">Setup an order type. Example - &ldquo;Counseling service&rdquo;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"fc74b469-1b62-4993-a09f-594b65bff09d\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">sql</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"linenumbers\">true</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[insert into order_type (name, description, creator, date_created, retired, uuid, java_class_name) values('Counseling service', 'Counseling service to patients', 1, now(), 0, uuid(), 'org.openmrs.Order');]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></li><li><p>Map the above &ldquo;order type&rdquo; to a concept class specifically for &ldquo;Counseling service&rdquo;. You can create a &ldquo;concept class&rdquo; from OpenMRS administration if a suitable one does not exist.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"b2fea6af-e5fe-4032-9017-e42f1f4ed88a\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">sql</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"linenumbers\">true</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[//Use this query to find appropriate concept class\nselect * from concept_class;\n\n//Now fire the insert statement to create a mapping to appropriate concept class.\ninsert into order_type_class_map (order_type_id, concept_class_id) values(<order type id>, <concept class id>);\n\n\n]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></li><li>In OpenMRS concept dictionary, setup a concept set for grouping &lsquo;Counseling&rsquo; services under &ldquo;All orderables&rdquo;<p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"b570042f-bee8-4b8e-be3b-4df93d0b1fa9\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"linenumbers\">true</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[All Orderables\n- Other Services\n --Counseling\n   ---Family Planning\n   ---Mental Health   ]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">While defining &ldquo;Family Planning&rdquo; Concept, please mark the &ldquo;saleable&rdquo; attribute to &ldquo;true&rdquo; and ensure that class chosen is what you have mapped to the order type above.</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot 2021-09-29 at 5.07.18 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"d1043195-1732-4d67-a44f-eeb5900f3d99\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Bulk Update Script</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>A script has been developed to bulk update the <code>saleable</code>&nbsp;attribute to true by reading the concept UUIDs from a CSV file. Refer <a href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/bahmni-scripts/tree/master/metadataScripts\">bahmni-scripts/metadatScripts/openmrs/set_saleable_attribute.sh</a> script for more details.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></li><li>Setup &ldquo;Order type&rdquo; and &ldquo;Shop mapping&rdquo; in Odoo.</li></ol><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Please follow instructions in the <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Sales Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"11\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Odoo sales configuration]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>.</p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0e946e18-3c2e-4a73-ae6d-cff7d89401e9\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>On This Page:</strong></p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0b1fb4dc-d4d3-4031-9baa-9f959aa24a67\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Ordering Laboratory and Radiology Tests\" ri:version-at-save=\"8\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Laboratory and Radiology Tab - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"8d910550-b229-4d7e-9a31-a6fab6802cfe\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">See Also</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Sales Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"11\" /></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
